# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and restart Metro.
#
# The Mokhotsi API (../api). Leave it unset for an offline-only build.
# USB (recommended): use http://127.0.0.1:8000 with `adb reverse tcp:8000 tcp:8000` —
# works in debug AND release (release allows plain HTTP to loopback only, see
# plugins/with-loopback-cleartext.js). Over Wi-Fi, use the computer's LAN address;
# that works in debug builds, but release builds refuse any non-loopback HTTP
# host, so a real deployment needs HTTPS here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Research builds only: shows Menu → Evaluation (owners) for measuring recognition
# accuracy and latency (docs/evaluation-protocol.md). Leave unset for shop builds.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EVALUATION=1
#
# Set on networks that block or intercept api.expo.dev (e.g. campus Wi-Fi):
# otherwise the Expo CLI throws UnexpectedServerError while serving the
# dev-client manifest and the app never loads. CLI-only; the app's own API
# calls are unaffected.
# EXPO_OFFLINE=1
